    {
        "model": "campaign_trail.answer",
        "pk": 42130,
        "fields": {
            "question": 42129,
            "description": "America, you have a choice. Do you want to walk out of your house, and see police and military on the streets, or be able to go about your life in peace?\n"
        }
    },
    {
        "model": "campaign_trail.answer",
        "pk": 42188,
        "fields": {
            "question": 42129,
            "description": "Four more years of Brennan and her so-called ‘America First’ foreign policy has crashed our economy, and drove up unemployment and inflation to 6.5% and 4.2% respectively. Can you deal with four more years like that?\n"
        }
    },
    {
        "model": "campaign_trail.answer",
        "pk": 42246,
        "fields": {
            "question": 42129,
            "description": "Brennan has divided our country, but it’s not too late. We, as Americans, have fought for freedom from oppression for hundreds of years, and now we must do it one last time at the ballot box.\n"
        }
    },
    {
        "model": "campaign_trail.answer",
        "pk": 42304,
        "fields": {
            "question": 42129,
            "description": "Over her four years in office, Brennan has turned our country into a White Christian Nationalist state, the exact same as our forefathers. I will fight for all Americans, Black, White, Latino, Asian. \n"
        }
    },
    {
        "model": "campaign_trail.answer",
        "pk": 42586,
        "fields": {
            "question": 1214,
            "description": "Let’s really try to maximise our strength with young voters, let’s work online with active groups and spread the message.\n"
