    },
    {
        "model": "campaign_trail.answer",
        "pk": 42817,
        "fields": {
            "question": 1221,
            "description": "No and Yes. Let’s show Brennan that she isn’t a true American, by showing our support for other countries. However, our nation's despicable acts on the international stage shouldn’t stop us from watching the World Cup, which is something that brings people from all around the globe.\n"
