    },
    {
        "model": "campaign_trail.answer",
        "pk": 42821,
        "fields": {
            "question": 1221,
            "description": "Yes and No. The Saudis have no respect for the lives of women and children, and should not be hosting a world cup. However, I see nothing wrong with supporting America. We’re still Americans, after all.\n"
